./working_notes/promising_directions.md:28:If two laws are observationally identical for \(D\) rounds and later rewards are controlled, minimax regret is at least \(D\Gamma\). More generally, Bayes regret is lower-bounded by world-specific comparator value minus the posterior-mixture quote envelope.
