- Need a precise minimax theorem for the policy class, law class, observation space, priors, and action space.
- Need to decide whether the exact claim is grid-restricted or continuum, and carry \(T/K\) errors correctly.
- Need regular conditional probabilities and measurable or \(\varepsilon\)-optimal selectors.
